@startuml
title P1 Windows local capture workflow
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor User
component "Main window / tray /\nRegisterHotKey" as UI
component "WindowsCaptureWorkflowController\n(single state owner)" as Workflow
component "WindowsRecordingController" as Recording
component "WindowsLocalSelfTestService" as SelfTest
component "WindowsMicrophoneCaptureService" as Capture
component "pulsar-capture.dll\nAppCapability + WASAPI" as Helper
component "FileOpenPicker / Explorer drop" as Files
component "CaptureMediaStore" as Store
component "WindowsAudioOutputController" as Output
component "WindowsOverlayMediaClipMixer" as Mixer

User --> UI
UI --> Workflow
Workflow --> Recording
Workflow --> SelfTest
Recording --> Capture
SelfTest --> Capture
Capture --> Helper
Capture --> Store
Files --> Workflow : brokered stream
SelfTest --> Store
SelfTest --> Mixer : cue + completed draft
Output --> Mixer : selected endpoint render

note right of Workflow
  Normal record and self-test are mutually exclusive.
  Paired/accountless launch use the same composition.
end note
@enduml
